      <title>Tech Disruptors: GitLab on Agentic Infrastructure, AI Controls</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-08-20/tech-disruptors-gitlab-on-agentic-infrastructure-ai-controls</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d44f1fb9ec48c76edd86ee2d</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:10:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Faster AI code generation is increasing the need for governance, security and control across the software-development life cycle, says Bill Staples, GitLab’s CEO. Staples joins Bloomberg Intelligence analyst Mandeep Singh on this episode of the Tech Disruptors podcast to discuss GitLab’s position as a cloud- and model-neutral orchestration layer for coding agents, as well as the shift from seat-based subscriptions toward a hybrid model that includes consumption pricing for agentic workloads.</description>
